<title>SWEDEN: NCC wins 530 mln SKR Sweden motorway deal.</title>
<headline>NCC wins 530 mln SKR Sweden motorway deal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company NCC said on Monday it had won an order from Sweden's Road Authority to build a motorway between Orebro and Arboga in southern Sweden worth 530 million crowns.  </p>
<p>NCC will build 26 kilometres of motorway, about 25 bridges and four junctions, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The order will strengthen NCC's position as an infra-structure builder,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Construction will take three years and the project will employ about 150 people.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
